    "Dear Logistica OS Talent Team, I would like to submit my application for the Founders Associate Intern position. My background in Management Engineering with a Master's in Innovation & Entrepreneurship at a European business school, combined with my passion for high-impact technology operations, is perfectly aligned with your mission. During my studies I led the go-to-market project for an innovative technology product and received recognition in a business competition. I have solid skills in data analysis with Python and advanced Excel, and an approach geared toward quickly solving operational problems. I would be thrilled to contribute to the growth and operational efficiency of Logistica OS. Kind regards, Alex Rossi",
